          "thinking_parse": "closed_thinking",
          "final_text": "To find the percentage of the Cabinets and Related Products segment's gross goodwill relative to the total gross goodwill as of December 31, 2010, I need to identify the relevant numbers from the document.\n\nFrom Note H (GOODWILL AND OTHER INTANGIBLE ASSETS) in the document, I can see the following information:\n\n| Segment | Gross Goodwill At December 31, 2010 |\n|---------|-----------------------------------|\n| Cabinets and Related Products | $587 million |\n| Total | $4,216 million |\n\nThe question asks for the percentage of Cabinets and Related Products to total gross goodwill.\n\nSo the calculation is:\n(Cabinets and Related Products Gross Goodwill / Total Gross Goodwill) × 100\n= ($587 million / $4,216 million) × 100\n= 0.1392 × 100\n= 13.92%\n\nTherefore, the percentage of the Cabinets and Related Products segment's gross goodwill to the total gross goodwill as of December 31, 2010 is 13.92%.\n\nFINAL: 13.92%",
